%% Overlay paint frame sequence
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  participant Surface as CanvasSurface
  participant Frame as FrameEngine
  participant Store as DocumentStoreKernel
  participant Preview as CanvasPreviewState
  participant MainPath as Main scene preview path
  participant Builder as Overlay primitive builder
  participant Painter as Overlay painter

  Surface->>Frame: paint overlay request(selectionStyle)
  Frame->>Store: capture cameraOffset once for overlay frame
  Store-->>Frame: cameraOffset
  Frame->>Preview: capture overlayRevision and immutable previewState once
  Preview-->>Frame: overlayRevision and immutable previewState
  Surface-->>Frame: selectionStyle for this paint frame
  Note over Frame: CapturedOverlayFrame freezes overlayRevision, cameraOffset, immutable previewState, and selectionStyle for this paint frame.

  Frame->>Frame: admit overlay preview kind from captured previewState only

  alt preview kind is marquee
    Frame->>Builder: build marquee fill and stroke primitive
  else preview kind is pencil or marker stroke
    Frame->>Builder: build stroke preview primitive
  else preview kind is pending line
    Frame->>Builder: build pending line start primitive
  else preview kind is line
    Frame->>Builder: build line preview primitive
  else preview kind is eraser
    Frame->>Builder: build eraser corridor primitive
  else preview kind is selected move
    Frame-->>MainPath: reject selected move from overlay admission
    Note over MainPath: Selected move preview is rendered by the main scene selected supplement path, never by overlay paint.
  else no overlay preview
    Frame->>Builder: build empty overlay primitive list
  end

  Builder-->>Frame: immutable overlay primitives
  Note over Builder,Frame: Primitive construction uses captured cameraOffset, previewState, and selectionStyle only.
  Frame->>Painter: paint captured overlay frame and immutable primitives
  Painter-->>Surface: draw overlay UI

  Note over Painter: Overlay painter consumes captured frame facts and immutable primitives only; it performs no live runtime reads.
  Note over Painter,Store: Forbidden: painter reads from DocumentStoreKernel, Store, InteractionEngine, FrameEngine runtime state, or public document projection.
  Note over Frame,Store: Forbidden in overlay paint: CanvasDocument materialization, DocumentProjectionCache reads, Store mutation, cache invalidation, repaint scheduling, and action events.
  Note over Surface,Painter: Forbidden: resource resolver reads and selected move rendering in overlay paint.
